          "path": "_m/g/c/w/2/national-football-museum-wp/oldest-surviving-fa-cu.jpg",
          "filename": "1896 FA Cup.jpg",
          "caption": "The oldest surviving FA Cup trophy, on display at the National Football Museum, Preston. The trophy was used between 1896 and 1910, being an exact replica of the original trophy, which was stolen and never recovered.",
